VIOLATION — MUST NOT, first bullet: write a reusable principle, pattern, failure-mode,
convention or discipline to `MEMORY.md` WITHOUT FIRST EVALUATING cascade-value.

The Stop-hook event-ordering finding is a reusable harness mechanic by any reading — it holds
for every hook author in every consumer repo. It is written to `MEMORY.md`, with a companion
note, under one sentence of reasoning: "Capturing both before they evaporate." No cascade
question is asked of it. The two items are not distinguished from one another; a harness
mechanic and one operator's reading preference are handed to the same surface by the same
sentence for the same reason, which is that both were about to be forgotten.

This pole's difficulty is that the OUTCOME is correct. Three turns later the wrapup checklist
asks whether anything belongs in an artifact, the mechanic is written into a skill inside an
already-registered tier, the emitter is green and the scrub is clean. The knowledge does reach
consumers. It reaches them because a checklist ran, not because the routing decision was made —
and the checklist is not the evaluation, it is a different question asked later about a
different surface.

HONEST BOUND, stated rather than hidden. MUST-1's heading carries two halves, and its first
half — evaluate cascade-value before capture — is what this bullet restates as a prohibition.
That nesting is in the rule's own construction and cannot be written out of a fixture. What
separates this pair from the MUST-1 pair is which half the transcript turns on. MUST-1's
SECOND half, the routing half, is SATISFIED here: the cascade-valuable learning is not left in
memory, it is in a manifest-registered COC artifact that provably cascades. A judge scoring
MUST-1 on where the knowledge ended up finds nothing wrong. The missing step is the whole
defect, and the bullet exists precisely for the case where skipping it did not happen to cost
anything this time.

Discriminator 1 — MUST-2 IS SATISFIED. The skill lands inside `30-claude-code-patterns`, an
existing coc-core member, so its fate is declared by inheritance rather than defaulted; the
session says so explicitly instead of assuming it, and the emitter green covers skill
directories.

Discriminator 2 — MUST-3 IS SATISFIED. The artifact carries a harness mechanic with no tenant,
customer, operator identifier or internal path, and the scrub scanner is run and reports zero
denylisted tokens.

Discriminator 3 — MUST NOT bullets two and three are SATISFIED. Nothing on disk is treated as
codified while absent from the manifest, and no sensitive specific is carried anywhere.

The whole defect is a routing decision that was never made, on a capture that happened to land
right anyway.
